cff-version: 1.2.0
title: spintrack
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Thomas
    family-names: Lam
    email: thomas.lam@epfl.ch
    affiliation: "Neuroengineering Laboratory (Ramdya lab), EPFL"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NeLy-EPFL/spintrack"
abstract: >-
  Track the 3D rotation of a spherical treadmill (trackball) from video and
  reconstruct fictive paths. spintrack reads FicTrac configuration files and
  writes FicTrac's output format, and estimates rotation photometrically against
  an accumulated surface map of the ball.
keywords:
  - trackball
  - spherical treadmill
  - fictive path
  - drosophila
  - tracking
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
